    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rub, Gub, and Bub are having a rough day\u2014they fell out of their monitor! As tiny rectangles representing the red, green, and blue parts of a pixel, they\u2019re crucial to keeping the screen running smoothly. But now they\u2019re lost, and the monitor\u2019s a total mess without them. It\u2019s up to you to guide them home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fun and relaxed 2D platformer, you\u2019ll help Rub, Gub, and Bub jump, stack, and solve puzzles to navigate their way back to their display. Each level introduces new challenges, from tricky jumps to clever puzzles, but teamwork is always the key. Switch between the three characters to combine their abilities, stack them to reach new heights, and work together to overcome every obstacle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game\u2019s minimalist visuals and colorful design make it easy on the eyes, while the simple, intuitive mechanics ensure anyone can pick it up and start playing. It\u2019s perfect for quick gaming sessions or a cozy evening spent helping these three rectangles reunite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, are you ready to bring the colors back to the screen and save the day? Rub, Gub, and Bub are counting on you\u2014let\u2019s get jumping!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rub, Gub, and Bub are having a rough day\u2014they fell out of their monitor! As tiny rectangles representing the red, green, and blue parts of a pixel, they\u2019re crucial to keeping the screen running smoothly. But now they\u2019re lost, and the monitor\u2019s a total mess without them. It\u2019s up to you to guide them home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fun and relaxed 2D platformer, you\u2019ll help Rub, Gub, and Bub jump, stack, and solve puzzles to navigate their way back to their display. Each level introduces new challenges, from tricky jumps to clever puzzles, but teamwork is always the key. Switch between the three characters to combine their abilities, stack them to reach new heights, and work together to overcome every obstacle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game\u2019s minimalist visuals and colorful design make it easy on the eyes, while the simple, intuitive mechanics ensure anyone can pick it up and start playing. It\u2019s perfect for quick gaming sessions or a cozy evening spent helping these three rectangles reunite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, are you ready to bring the colors back to the screen and save the day? Rub, Gub, and Bub are counting on you\u2014let\u2019s get jumping!</p>",
    "short_description": "What happens when three tiny rectangles\u2014Rub, Gub, and Bub\u2014get lost from their screen? Chaos! Help them jump, stack, and puzzle their way back home in this fun, casual 2D platformer. Simple, colorful, and just the right amount of tricky!",
